        "cf1e9c5e-2cff-4b11-b8c7-d199011e2a56": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "RULES & RESTRICTIONS",
            "text": "<p>As with all good things, rules and restrictions apply. All non-Black Friday specific promo codes will be inactive beginning Friday, 11\/10\/23, at 12:01AM PST and will be reactivated Tuesday, 11\/28\/2023 at 12:01 AM PST. Discounts or promotions may not be combined with any Black Friday offerings. All products, excluding Second Chance footwear, come with standard manufacturer warranties. Standard return, exchange, and 30 day trials apply, unless otherwise noted. Second Chance models and Customized items are FINAL SALE and therefore return, exchange, warranty and 30 trial policies do not apply. Free Shipping applies to all orders totaling $100+. Original shipping fees are not refundable. If a Black Friday promotional digital gift card is earned with purchase and the original purchase is partially or fully returned, the gift card (a) if unused, will be disabled or (b) if used, the gift card value will be withheld from refund issued as the purchase no longer meets the free gift card threshold. Black Friday\/Cyber Monday Deals are not retroactive and will not apply to any purchases made prior to the sale. Please contact TRUE Customer Care with any questions or concerns during business hours via <a href=\"mailto:help@truelinkswear.com\">help@truelinkswear.com <\/a>or chat on <a href=\"http:\/\/truelinkswear.com\/\">truelinkswear.com<\/a>. Golden Tickets are distributed at random throughout the Black Friday  promotion, ending on November 27th. Once winners are decided, they will be put in contact with designated representatives of each player and responsible for working directly with them to schedule the virtual meeting. Players and individual schedules will need to be understood prior to scheduling. Golden Ticket participants may change during the scheduled promotion. The content of the call is subject to both parties and may or may not include a virtual lesson or any other kind of topic or conversation. TRUE linkswear reserves the right to adjust, change, or alter any of the Black Friday promotions at any time. The TRUE Black Friday promise is made on a best-effort basis. If an order is eligible for a free TRUE Gift Card, that order cannot also be paid for with a TRUE Gift Card. If an order is paid for with a TRUE gift card it is no longer eligible for the free TRUE Gift Card portion of the Black Friday 2023 sale, however may be applied to the total amount of the order.<\/p>",
            "link": "",
            "button_text_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "",
            "button_type_1": "primary",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": "",
            "button_type_2": "primary"
          }
        }
